at UCO Retirement Legal Disclosures Risk Management and Safety Operations Shop Central Human Resources Bausher Place, Office Suite 208 hr@uco.edu 405-974-2366 UCO Human Resources (HR) works to empower UCO faculty and staff to bring their best selves to work every day, so that together we can impact UCO’s mission, our students and our community. We are innovative and results-oriented professionals committed to providing the best in HR practices. We value integrity, reliability and innovation in our work. With an in-depth knowledge of all Human Resources functions and processes, the HR team is here to support UCO faculty and staff throughout their experience with the university – from the moment a position is accepted through the day of separation or retirement. The University of Central Oklahoma is committed to creating a welcoming and inclusive working environment through recruiting, supporting and retaining a diverse faculty and staff. UCO is an exceedingly diverse institution with a global outlook that is reflected in our student body, dedicated faculty, staff and university administration. Our recognition of diversity includes an awareness of the many issues and challenges which confront underrepresented groups. We know having a diverse workforce is key to making UCO successful. Current Faculty and Staff Resources The Hub Paycom Employee Assistance Program UCO Cares The Broncho Beat Newsletter Affinity Groups Retiree Resources Retiree Benefits UCO Maps Human Resources Bausher Place, Office Suite 208 hr@uco.edu 405-974-2366 Careers at UCO career career Careers campus-building campus-building Why Work at UCO? teamwork-table teamwork-table Retirement Contact Us Human Resources Bausher Place, Office Suite 208 405-974-2366 hr@uco.edu Central Oklahoma University of Central Oklahoma Logo University of Central Oklahoma 100 N. University Drive Edmond, Oklahoma 73034 405-974-2000 Contact Us Building, Walking and Parking Maps Give to UCO Library Campus Safety Copyright © 20